value.MOON_INTENSITY.2=Standar
value.MOON_INTENSITY.3=Bulan Terang
value.MOON_INTENSITY.4=Malam Penuh
option.SUN_TEMPERATURE=Suhu Warna Matahari
option.SUN_TEMPERATURE.comment=Menggeser kurva Kelvin matahari. Realistis menggunakan benda hitam Tanner Helland; hangat = keemasan; sejuk = putih netral.
value.SUN_TEMPERATURE.1=Sejuk / Netral
value.SUN_TEMPERATURE.2=Realistis
value.SUN_TEMPERATURE.3=Keemasan Hangat
option.MOON_TEMPERATURE=Suhu Warna Bulan
option.MOON_TEMPERATURE.comment=Corak cahaya bulan. Dingin Beku = biru kebiruan dingin; Perak = realistis 4100K; Hangat = krem bulan panen.
